745:**Auto-launch:** The daemon calls `bin/ensure-cdp-9222` before invoking any CDP-requiring skill. If Chrome is not already running on port 9222, the helper launches it with the operator's persistent profile at `/Users/alinaaitova/.chrome-automation`. Skills also call the helper from their "Mandatory CDP Discipline" section as defence in depth (in case Chrome crashes mid-execution).
772:| `CDP_ENSURE_HELPER_PATH` | repo `bin/ensure-cdp-9222` | Override the helper path (used by the daemon's tests to inject mocks) |
833:- Each invokes `bin/ensure-cdp-9222` in its body.
